		"description": "<p>At 17th level, you can unleash your indomitable spirit to take your enemies with you: if you take damage that would reduce you to 0hp, spend all your remaining exertion points to reflect the damage back at the attacker: the attacker must make a Wisdom Saving Throw against your Maneuver DC or take the damage instead of you. If they succeed, you both take the same damage.</p>",
